Summary: (H) is PROVED for v > v* = r_P/(pi |G'_P|) per core; the residual (H)-band is
v in (maxP, v*], nonempty only when the core is tight (|G'| small): the band edge is an
exact computable of the core -- the moderate regime is no longer uniform-open.
